<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 17/18.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 17/18.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Friday, April 18 on Thursday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   18.04.97	  17.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.4996	    6.5046</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3182	    2.3179</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5280	    4.5298</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.1892	    3.1727</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5186	    0.5198</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7727	    0.7725</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2899	    0.2898</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8853	    6.8865</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6954	    0.6958</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2761	    1.2807</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
